{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parrot Hero</strong> is a charming pixel-art action-adventure set in a world ruled entirely by birds.<br>You play as <i>Byeol</i>, the only human mistakenly believed to be a mutant emperor penguin, who embarks on a journey with a grumpy, talkative parrot companion named <i>Haetbiti</i> to rescue the kidnapped parrot <i>Dalbiti</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From lush forests and massive construction sites to towering castle walls and coastal shores,<br>you\u2019ll explore over <strong>37 stages across 6 unique chapters</strong>, encountering a wide variety of bird monsters, quirky NPCs, and diverse mission objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the secrets of this bird-only world, choose your class, upgrade your parrot companion\u2019s skills,<br>and dive into a whimsical adventure full of feathers, fun, and fast-paced action!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4042360?t=1768131883","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4042360?t=1768131883","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042360/f2f2c335d52bb661e493cf15bbe7c59cca2b48e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768131883","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042360/f2f2c335d52bb661e493cf15bbe7c59cca2b48e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768131883","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parrot Hero</strong> is a charming pixel-art action-adventure set in a world ruled entirely by birds.<br>You play as <i>Byeol</i>, the only human mistakenly believed to be a mutant emperor penguin, who embarks on a journey with a grumpy, talkative parrot companion named <i>Haetbiti</i> to rescue the kidnapped parrot <i>Dalbiti</i>.</p><p 